assName":104,"code":105,"language":72,"meta":42},[70],"{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer 这里填写你的Token\",\"Accept\":\"application/json\"}\n",[44,107,105],{"__ignoreMap":42},[24,109,110,111],{},"比如你的Token是",[44,112,113],{"code":113},"mytoken-test",[24,115,116],{},"那么你的自定义请求头就写为:",[36,118,121],{"className":119,"code":120,"language":72,"meta":42},[70],"{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer mytoken-test\",\"Accept\":\"application/json\"}\n",[44,122,120],{"__ignoreMap":42},[24,124,125,126,129],{},"之后就可以正常使用了，包括与",[28,127,128],{},"Typora","联动。",{"title":42,"searchDepth":131,"depth":131,"links":132},4,[133,135,136],{"id":12,"depth":134,"text":13},2,{"id":21,"depth":134,"text":22},{"id":84,"depth":134,"text":85},[138],"配置","2025-08-01 17:15:43","PicGo实现去图图床配置，通过下载第三方插件，配置HEAD以及Body实现上传以及和Typora的联动",false,"md","https://7.isyangs.cn/20250801/cc418048d677e4b6a6d512f75603b372.png",{},true,"/2025/picgo","---\ntitle: PicGo配置去图图床\ndescription: PicGo实现去图图床配置，通过下载第三方插件，配置HEAD以及Body实现上传以及和Typora的联动\ndate: 2025-08-01 17:15:43\nupdated: 2025-08-04 \nimage: https://7.isyangs.cn/20250801/cc418048d677e4b6a6d512f75603b372.png\n# type: story\ncategories: [配置]\ntags: [插件]\n\n---\n\n## 1、下载web-uploader插件\n::pic\n---\nsrc: https://7.isyangs.cn/20250801/8feea263d6805764727fbb2fa9a9dd8f.png\ncaption: 第三方插件\n---\n::\n## 2、点击图床设置\n\n配置如下，按着配置就行了。注意的是自定义请求头里要填写你自己的**Token**。\n\nAPI地址为:\n```bash\nhttps://7tu.top/api/v2/upload\n```\n\nPOST参数名为:\n\n```bash\nfile\n```\n\nJSON路径为:\n\n```bash\ndata.public_url\n```\n\n自定义Body为:\n\n```js\n{\"storage_id\":\"5\",\"is_public\":\"0\"}\n```\n\n这里is_public是选择是否公开图片。按照自己需求即可。\n\n::pic\n---\nsrc: https://7.isyangs.cn/20250801/b4db61781c20c78bf7a3505d7023b949.png\ncaption: 图床配置\n---\n::\n\n## 3、自定义请求头\n\n如何获取**Token**？\n\n点击我的令牌，新建即可，记得保存，一会填请求头会用到。\n\n::pic\n---\nsrc: https://7.isyangs.cn/20250801/d265b50e104fcc5263ea901888f05039.png\ncaption: \n---\n::\n\n请求头的格式如下:\n```js\n{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer 这里填写你的Token\",\"Accept\":\"application/json\"}\n```\n\n比如你的Token是`mytoken-test`\n\n那么你的自定义请求头就写为:\n\n```js\n{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer mytoken-test\",\"Accept\":\"application/json\"}\n```\n\n之后就可以正常使用了，包括与**Typora**联动。\n",{"text":149,"minutes":150,"time":151,"words":152},"1 min read",0.85,51000,170,null,{"title":5,"description":140},{"loc":146},"posts/2025/PicGo实现去图图床",[158],"插件","2025-08-04","Vk8IoOvi3y1arcA__vxcOaiD-CI2ZWCjKX7m7bMbiSg",[162,167],{"title":163,"path":164,"stem":165,"date":166,"type":153,"children":-1},"Git自动化部署","/2025/git","posts/2025/Git自动化部署","2025-07-31 19:42:40",{"title":168,"path":169,"stem":170,"date":171,"type":153,"children":-1},"复习——数学篇","/2025/review-math","posts/2025/review-math","2025-08-20 21:45:38",1785300491044]